> 
> Even if you dip a cursed potion into a potion of completely normal (not
> holy, not unholy) water?

Dipping a potion into ordinary water will dilute that potion on the
first dip, and will "dilute it further" (i.e. turn it to water) the
second time. The (water-)potions where you dipped into will vanish
in that process. (BTW, the other way round, dipping water into any
non-water potion is not so good.)

